    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"liberating\"? i don't know if i'd call it that. it just feels heavy. it feels like everything is getting quieter and colder. i keep thinking that if i just... stopped trying to keep the lights on, maybe it wouldn't hurt so much to be alone in the dark. like, why fight to stay awake when there's nothing left to see?",
